author TwinGears@gmail.com
ccmd put wear press push pull sit stand touch
rmlevel 1000
setplayerstart R0
maplock true
maplabel 'Meditation Time'
rmlabel 'Floating Golden Dust Space'
untake 'meditation cushion' up down
hide down up
+tw sit down TW load TwinGears@gmail.com 'Meditation Space'
+tw stand up TW load TwinGears@gmail.com EarthShip R10
rtw timer 00:00:00:1 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:00:00:1 TW comm false 'Cultivate your Qi energy for 10 minutes, type stand up or move to quit timer training loop.'
rtw timer 00:00:00:1 TW playsound 'FriedEggs014AlmostBell.ogg'
rtw timer 00:00:00:3 TW playsound 'BongRing002.ogg'
repeat 00:00:01:0 00:09:59:0 rtw timer 00:00:05:0 TW playsound 'Clock2TicECCO.ogg'
rtw timer 00:10:00:0 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:10:00:0 TW comm false 'Now sit absolutely still upright for 10 minutes, no movements, no intentions anywhere, no leaking internal noise - be absolutely still!’
rtw timer 00:10:00:0 TW playsound 'BassSlide7.ogg'

rtw timer 00:20:00:0 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:20:00:0 TW comm false 'Cultivate your Qi energy for 10 minutes.'
rtw timer 00:20:00:0 TW playsound 'BongRing002.ogg'
repeat 00:20:01:0 00:29:59:0 rtw timer 00:00:05:0 TW playsound 'Clock2TicECCO.ogg'
rtw timer 00:30:00:0 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:30:00:0 TW comm false 'Now sit absolutely still upright for 10 minutes, no movements, no intentions anywhere, no leaking internal noise - be absolutely still! '
rtw timer 00:30:00:0 TW comm false 'You may find yourself forcing all noise to stop! Which only leaves you with that one thing now to let go of – self control. Either way get used to arriving at being silent regardless and you may find out there never was a FEAR-TEST, just a common miss UNDER-STANDING about a telepathic data stream. Not all your thoughts or sensations are yours, some times that extreme fear you feel is another, whom have every right to be scared of a traumatically programmed WAR-MONKEY raised by GROUP-STUPID!'
rtw timer 00:30:00:0 TW playsound 'BassSlide6.ogg'

rtw timer 00:40:00:0 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:40:00:0 TW comm false 'Cultivate your Qi energy for 10 minutes.'
rtw timer 00:40:00:0 TW playsound 'BongRing002.ogg'
repeat 00:40:01:0 00:49:59:0 rtw timer 00:00:03:0 TW playsound 'ClockTIC.ogg'
rtw timer 00:50:00:0 TW clrtxt
rtw timer 00:50:00:0 TW comm false 'Now sit absolutely still upright for 10 minutes, no movements, no intentions anywhere, no leaking internal noise - be absolutely still!'
rtw timer 00:50:00:0 TW playsound 'BassSlide3.ogg'
rtw timer 01:00:00:0 TW timer 00:00:00:0
